==History==
2016
*The Elite Barbarians [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 25/11/2016.
*On 15/12/2016, a [[Version History#December 2016 Update (15/12/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Elite Barbarians' hitpoints by 19%, their damage by 14% and decreased their attack time interval to 1.4 seconds (from 1.5 seconds).
2017
*On 23/1/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (23/1/2017)|Balance Update]], decreased the Elite Barbarians' hitpoints by 4.4%, damage by 4% and increased their attack time interval to 1.5 seconds (from 1.4 seconds).
*On 19/4/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (19/4/2017)|Balance Update]], decreased the Elite Barbarians' hitpoints by 4%, and increased their first attack time interval to 0.5 seconds (from 0.4 seconds).
2018
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Elite Barbarians from Royal Arena to Hog Mountain.
2019
*On 3/6/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/6/2019)|Balance Update]], increased the Elite Barbarians' damage by 18%, but increased their attack time interval to 1.7 seconds (from 1.5 seconds), and their first attack time interval to 0.7 seconds (from 0.5 seconds).
*On 1/7/2019, the [[Version History#July%202019%20Update%20(1/7/2019)|July 2019 Update]], increased the Elite Barbarians' range to 1.2 tiles (from 1 tile), now classified as Melee: Medium.
2020
*On 2/6/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/6/2020)|Balance Update]], gave the Elite Barbarians a new 0.1 seconds deploy stagger from each other.
*On 3/11/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/11/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Elite Barbarians' speed to 90 (from 120), now classified as Fast, decreased their attack time interval to 1.5 seconds (from 1.7 seconds), increased their hitpoints by 14%, and increased their damage by 5.5%. Their first attack time interval was also decreased to 0.5 seconds (from 0.7 seconds).
2021
*On 30/3/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%201%20Update%20(30/3/2021)|2021 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Elite Barbarians' attack time interval to 1.4 seconds (from 1.5 seconds) and their first attack time interval to 0.4 seconds (from 0.5 seconds).
*On 7/4/2021, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (7/4/2021)|maintenance break]], increased the Elite Barbarians' first attack time interval to 0.5 seconds (from 0.4 seconds).
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], increased the Elite Barbarians' sight range to 6 tiles (from 5.5 tiles).
*On 2/9/2021, a maintenance break, added a card render to the Elite Barbarians' card info screen.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).

